00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.940
because it was what it felt was right.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:56.020
'Cause I didn't want to cheat. I did not want to cheat- even if I had to start over again and play for twenty more hours

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:01.040
Just to get back to this point here, I was about to do that.

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:08.480
