00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:13.260
in my save file and going back to the stable version and trying to load it up there.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:20.180
And it worked and I'm here, and I'm here and it worked and I don't have to waste twenty hours of my life..

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.460
Getting back to this point here.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.520
